  dex-core/tests/apk_entries_test.rs; zip added as a dev-dependency of dex-core (same version).
  CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased].
- M1b: dex-core/src/axml.rs and dex-core/src/manifest.rs (new), exported from dex-core/src/lib.rs;
