  (Cargo.lock); docs/architecture.md; CHANGELOG.md.
- M4: dex-sdk/src/report.rs, dex-sdk/src/diff.rs and dex-sdk/tests/diff_test.rs; Deserialize on
  the match types; docs/architecture.md; CHANGELOG.md.
