  no APK and no Exodus data). dex-core/examples/manifest_json.rs (new). A `.#eval` dev shell in
  flake.nix; eval-test, fdroid-select and fdroid-eval recipes in the Justfile; `.cache/` in
  .gitignore, and (7830f55) `__pycache__/` and `*.pyc`.
